// Constraints that combine: graph fetches, CHECKED, of the checks:: pack's classes (8117-checks.pure), whose
// twenty constraints combine dates, enumeration values, string functions, exists, forAll and size over a to-many
// property, an `if`, a dateDiff and navigated properties, over seed rows that violate each one. Each object comes
// back with its defects, which the reference evaluator computes by evaluating every constraint over the fetched
// graph as the engine checks it; an unchecked fetch reads only objects with none, and a projection evaluates no
// constraint -- see scripts/corpus/checks.py.
//
// GENERATED by scripts/corpus/build.py -- do not edit by hand.

###Data
Data checks::CheckData
{
  Relational
  #{
    default.CK_BASKET:
      'BASKET_ID,KIND,CCY,CLOSE_DATE,DESK_ID\n' +
